     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The unit comes first",
     "texto": [
      "You say the unit first, then **og** (and), then the tens. All together:\n\n- 21 = **en**og**tyve** (one and twenty)\n- 38 = **otte**og**tredive**\n- 49 = **ni**og**fyrre**\n\nAlways listen to the end before writing the figure!"
     ],
